        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.5+2SA.16.6+2SA.16.7+2SA.16.8+2SA.16.9+2SA.16.10+2SA.16.11+2SA.16.12+2SA.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 16:5-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simeyi mutabani wa Gera, ow'oruganda rwa Bbenyamiini ayarugire Bahulimu, atabandaale, yagenda hamu n'abasaija ab'oruganda rwa Yuda kwitirana omukama Daudi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akaba aina abasaija rukumi ab'oruganda rwa Bbenyamiini. Ziba omuheereza ow'omunju ya Saulo, hamu n'abatabani ikumi na bataano, n'abaheereza makumi abiri, na uwe yagenda bwango Yorudaani omumaiso g'omukama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baayambuka omwogo kwambura abantu b'omukama n'okukora ekyarukusiima. Omukama obwakaba ali haihi kwambuka Yorudaani, Simeyi mutabani wa Gera yajuumara omumaiso ge ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamugambira ati: “Mukama wange otanjunaana kandi ekibi nyowe omwiru wawe ekinakozire, ha kiro ekiwarugiireho Yerusaalemu; oleke kukiijuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe omwiru wawe, mmanyire nkooku nasiisire; kiro kinu, nikyo nyiziire ndi w'okubanza ha bantu boona ab'enju ya Yosefu, nyije nkutangaane iwe MUKAMA wange omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisayi mutabani wa Zeruya yakaguza ati: “Simeyi tasemeriire kwitwa habwokuba akakondereza omuseeswaho amagita wa MUKAMA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Daudi yakaguza ati: “Inywe batabani ba Zeruya, abanfookiire banyanzigwa, kiro kya hati mbakole ki? Kiro kya hati tihabeho omuntu araitwa omu Isirairi, habwokuba ninyowe mukama wa Isirairi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yagambira Simeyi ati: “Nkurahiire, torukwija kufa.” Yamurahira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
